exapostilarion.text:
As an excellent victor over the passions, O Nicephorus, thou hast received a twofold crown from Christ the Savior;
for, casting down the God-opposing heresy of those who reject the divine icons, O most wise hierarch,
thou wast a champion of the spiritual athletes of piety.//
O blessed father, pray for us who honor thee.

bothNow.text:
Without leaving the bosom of the Father, Thou wast incarnate of the Virgin, O Lord;
for, bowing down the heavens, thou didst descend to save me who am fallen,
desiring to rescue from the mouth of the noetic beast me who am stuck fast in his clutches.//
Wherefore, delivered, I glorify Thy power.
